Guy Morgan.


00:07:03.938 --> 00:07:05.769
Could you give his son, Luke, a tour?


00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.807
Sure. Would you like
to see the Wellesley perks?


00:07:08.976 --> 00:07:11.604
Um, yes, brilliant. Sure.


00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:14.070
- Katie.
I love your accent.


00:07:14.248 --> 00:07:15.840
Katie.
Wanna come over tonight?


00:07:16.016 --> 00:07:18.382
What are you still doing here? Go.


00:07:18.552 --> 00:07:21.953
