00:07:36.837 --> 00:07:38.532
Watch out.


00:07:39.006 --> 00:07:41.031
- Dangerous balls.
- Ha, ha. Thanks.


00:07:42.042 --> 00:07:45.637
- So you womanned up and did it?
Hey!


00:07:45.813 --> 00:07:47.610
- Oh, I did it.
Hey!


00:07:47.781 --> 00:07:50.147
- What happened?
Can we have our ball?


00:07:50.317 --> 00:07:51.682
I didn't give my CD to Luke.


00:07:51.852 --> 00:07:54.844
I snuck it in his dad's bag.


00:07:55.022 --> 00:07:58.981
But Guy Morgan has your demo.
That's huge. What you need is a champion.


00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.889
No, what I need is to graduate.


00:08:01.729 --> 00:08:03.629
You giving our ball back or what?


00:08:03.797 --> 00:08:07.426
Oh, do you want this?


00:08:12.239 --> 00:08:15.504
She shoots, she scores.
Unlike you, soccer boy.


00:08:17.845 --> 00:08:21.576
Oh, so spill it. Is Luke Morgan
as hot as everyone Tweets he is?


00:08:21.749 --> 00:08:23.114
Hotter.


00:08:23.284 --> 00:08:24.911
You should ask him to the dance.


00:08:25.085 --> 00:08:27.315
Because I'm so forward with guys.


00:08:27.488 --> 00:08:30.048
First time for everything, right?


00:08:37.198 --> 00:08:38.893
- Hi, Luke.
- Hello.


00:08:39.066 --> 00:08:40.294
