00:08:40.768 --> 00:08:43.828
It's a retro-funk-jazz explosion.


00:08:44.004 --> 00:08:46.199
Back off. I was here first.


00:08:46.373 --> 00:08:49.831
Hold on, hold up. Please hold on.
My boy does not want your demos yet.


00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:52.274
Walk away. Move along. Bye.


00:08:52.446 --> 00:08:55.813
It was nice chatting
or whatever that was.


00:08:56.083 --> 00:08:58.415
- Yes, hi, I'm, uh...
- Luke Morgan, right?


00:08:58.586 --> 00:09:00.110
Who is producing the Showcase.


00:09:00.287 --> 00:09:03.188
I don't think I'm gonna do the Showcase,
so I need to keep a low profile...


00:09:03.357 --> 00:09:06.793
Yeah, yeah. Listen close now.
There's two kinds of people in this school.


00:09:06.961 --> 00:09:10.488
There are the wannabes
and there's gonnabes.


00:09:10.664 --> 00:09:15.829
You and I, we're gonnabes. What do we do?
We stay away from the wannabes, all right?


00:09:16.003 --> 00:09:19.564
And girls named Yolanda. There are three
of them and they are certifiably...


00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.833
Crazy? You attract
crazy women? Shocking.


00:09:22.009 --> 00:09:24.910
It may seem like I don't have game,
but ladies love a listener.


00:09:25.079 --> 00:09:27.206
Plus, I'm telling you,
let me help you find acts.


00:09:27.381 --> 00:09:30.407
- Ah, so you're a talent scout?
- Well, bottom line, I'm a DJ.


00:09:30.584 --> 00:09:32.779
- Oh, you're a DJ as well?
- Check this.


00:09:41.328 --> 00:09:42.590
Whoa.


00:09:42.763 --> 00:09:45.857
Okay, yes. You could be very useful.
It was nice meeting you.


00:09:46.033 --> 00:09:48.695
You got a girl for the dance?
Because I can hook you up.


00:09:48.869 --> 00:09:50.029
Uh, no. Thanks.


00:09:50.204 --> 00:09:53.605
Uh, but what do you know
about Bev Van Ravensway?


00:09:53.774 --> 00:09:55.435
- Supposed to see her tonight.
- Bev?


00:09:55.609 --> 00:09:56.633
- Yeah.
- She's hot...


00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:59.278
...but the girl
is mad, mad drama, okay?


00:09:59.446 --> 00:10:01.846
I am talking to you
and you don't even know my name.


00:10:02.016 --> 00:10:03.916
- I'm Mickey O'Malley.
- Mickey O'Malley.


00:10:04.084 --> 00:10:05.711
A rarity in the Irish community.


00:10:06.287 --> 00:10:08.380
Om.


00:10:09.189 --> 00:10:11.817
RAVl: Om.
- Om.


00:10:11.992 --> 00:10:14.085
- Om.
- Om!


00:10:14.261 --> 00:10:16.786
This is not a contest, Ms. Gail.


00:10:17.164 --> 00:10:18.791
Just concentrate on your breathing.


00:10:20.301 --> 00:10:21.461
My butt is numb.


00:10:21.802 --> 00:10:24.999
If your butt is suffering,
then you are suffering.


00:10:25.172 --> 00:10:28.630
In fact, your entire life is suffering. Why?


00:10:28.809 --> 00:10:31.903
Because you crave
that which is meaningless.


00:10:32.079 --> 00:10:34.070
Are you calling me shallow?


00:10:35.149 --> 00:10:40.985
No, I'm saying to stop your craving
and release your butt.


00:10:41.155 --> 00:10:44.716
Just release it. Release it, yeah.
Release that butt.


00:10:45.592 --> 00:10:48.652
<i>Release that butt
Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:48.829 --> 00:10:51.423
<i>Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:51.598 --> 00:10:52.895
Mrs. Van Ravensway?


00:10:53.067 --> 00:10:55.592
What part
of "if you interrupt my meditation...


00:10:55.769 --> 00:10:58.966
