00:11:58.465 --> 00:11:59.489
<i>Ow.</i>


00:11:59.666 --> 00:12:02.100
<i>What are you doing?
I'm on the phone.</i>


00:12:02.269 --> 00:12:03.861
<i>- I'm cleansing.
Heh, heh.</i>


00:12:04.071 --> 00:12:06.301
Mac and cheese.


00:12:07.207 --> 00:12:10.335
<i>I don't need your spiritual counseling.</i>


00:12:10.878 --> 00:12:12.436
<i>I'm thinking of firing you.</i>


00:12:17.951 --> 00:12:21.318
Pace yourself, Ms. Gail,
or you will not be one with everything.


00:12:21.488 --> 00:12:24.821
Honey, that's what I got you for.
Now, make me one with everything.


00:12:26.226 --> 00:12:29.423
This Showcase is giving me the vapors.


00:12:29.596 --> 00:12:31.689
How did this become my life?


00:12:31.865 --> 00:12:34.857
Did I ever tell you all about the time
I nearly got my big break?


00:12:35.035 --> 00:12:36.525
Yes.
- Good.


00:12:36.703 --> 00:12:38.136
Then you all know how it goes.


00:12:38.572 --> 00:12:40.767
<i>I ain't gonna leap, I'm gonna jump</i>


00:12:40.941 --> 00:12:43.273
<i>Find my way right out of this dump</i>


00:12:46.113 --> 00:12:48.980
- I had talent, and they made me...
A laughingstock.


00:12:50.751 --> 00:12:52.048
Now look at me.


00:12:52.219 --> 00:12:54.710
I got two ungrateful kids...


00:12:54.888 --> 00:12:57.880
...a dwarfish, hairy, elfin servant...


00:12:58.058 --> 00:13:00.049
