01:04:34.436 --> 01:04:35.903
How many cameras do you have?


01:04:36.071 --> 01:04:38.801
Enough to know your accent's
faker than my mom's soul.


01:04:38.974 --> 01:04:42.432
Oh, and don't get the dumb idea
to throw that Showcase.


01:04:42.611 --> 01:04:43.942
Because I talked to a lawyer.


01:04:44.112 --> 01:04:48.811
And he found a loophole that allows me
to access that money your daddy left you...


01:04:48.984 --> 01:04:51.544
...should I need it for a medical reason.


01:04:51.720 --> 01:04:54.587
<i>You know, hello, longer legs.</i>


01:04:54.756 --> 01:04:58.419
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Before you go...
- I'll sing for Bev. Don't worry.


01:04:58.893 --> 01:05:00.918
Well, that was easier than I thought.


01:05:01.096 --> 01:05:02.961
Now, go and make me a vodka tonic.


01:05:03.131 --> 01:05:04.689
Hold the tonic.


01:05:14.409 --> 01:05:16.400
Her reign of terror's gotta stop.


01:05:16.578 --> 01:05:18.102
I'm in. What do we do?


01:05:18.280 --> 01:05:20.111
Look, there's nothing you can do.


01:05:20.782 --> 01:05:23.148
If you try to help,
it's just gonna make it worse.


01:05:23.318 --> 01:05:26.344
That woman is a demon
spawned from darkness itself.


01:05:26.521 --> 01:05:27.852
I wish she'd go straight back to...


01:05:28.023 --> 01:05:29.854
Hello, Ms. Gail.


01:05:30.025 --> 01:05:33.426
Have you, uh, released your mind
from the shackles of thinking today?


01:05:33.595 --> 01:05:35.495
- I'm working on it.
- Very good.


01:05:35.764 --> 01:05:38.494
- How was your meditation?
I hate you.


01:05:38.867 --> 01:05:41.131
Very good. You look pretty.


01:05:41.303 --> 01:05:42.998
I know.


01:05:44.673 --> 01:05:47.506
That broad
ain't getting away with ruining your life.


01:05:47.676 --> 01:05:49.337
I'm pooping in her bed tonight.


01:05:49.511 --> 01:05:52.344
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:52.514 --> 01:05:53.606
Are you an idiot?


01:05:53.782 --> 01:05:55.943
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:56.117 --> 01:05:57.982
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:58.153 --> 01:06:00.553
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:06:00.722 --> 01:06:02.917
You're annoying and ugly...


01:06:03.091 --> 01:06:04.490
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:06.928 --> 01:06:08.555
I sort of love you too.


01:06:09.164 --> 01:06:13.624
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:14.102 --> 01:06:15.694
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:15.870 --> 01:06:17.804
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:17.972 --> 01:06:19.462
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:20.375 --> 01:06:21.706
Okay.


01:06:21.976 --> 01:06:26.379
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:41.896 --> 01:06:45.525
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:45.800 --> 01:06:47.961
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:48.136 --> 01:06:50.229
Oh, okay.


01:06:50.405 --> 01:06:52.930
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:53.842 --> 01:06:57.744
- You actually want my opinion?
- God, I know. What's wrong with me?


01:06:58.713 --> 01:07:02.615
You know how you're a bitch and I act
like I don't care, but truth is I'm sensitive?


01:07:02.784 --> 01:07:05.309
- Actually...
- I need someone to talk to like a sister...


01:07:05.487 --> 01:07:07.387
...and you're better than nothing.


01:07:08.857 --> 01:07:13.294
I'm nervous about tonight.
Oh, my God, why did I just tell you that?


01:07:15.163 --> 01:07:17.256
I don't know.


01:07:17.599 --> 01:07:19.863
It's like my whole body is freaking out.


01:07:20.034 --> 01:07:21.126
I have hives on my butt.


01:07:21.302 --> 01:07:23.770
I can't tell Mom
and I can't talk to Luke about it.


01:07:23.938 --> 01:07:25.303
He'll say something like:


01:07:25.473 --> 01:07:28.408
"Oh, one minute
you're talented and we're connecting...


01:07:28.576 --> 01:07:31.807
...and the next minute you're self-involved
and histrionic."


01:07:31.980 --> 01:07:35.211
- What does that even mean? I hate history.
- He said that?


01:07:37.051 --> 01:07:40.919
Listen, Toadie, he's not falling for you,
he's falling for me.


01:07:41.089 --> 01:07:42.784
I just don't know who me is anymore.


01:07:42.957 --> 01:07:45.255
Why are you nervous?
You're not really singing.


01:07:45.427 --> 01:07:48.487
All you have to do is stand there
and look pretty.


01:07:50.064 --> 01:07:52.897
Have you ever thought
about how that makes me feel?


01:07:53.701 --> 01:07:55.168
You have talent.


01:07:55.336 --> 01:07:58.828
<i>You could go on American Idol
and forget about the rest of us.</i>


01:07:59.073 --> 01:08:01.405
This is, like, my only chance.


01:08:02.110 --> 01:08:03.839
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:08:04.012 --> 01:08:05.946
Just look at Mom.


01:08:08.116 --> 01:08:09.242
You think I'm talented?


01:08:11.052 --> 01:08:13.145
If you tell anyone I said that, I'll deny it.


01:08:14.856 --> 01:08:16.380
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:16.558 --> 01:08:18.526
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:21.629 --> 01:08:22.857
This better work.


01:08:23.431 --> 01:08:25.661
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:38.646 --> 01:08:42.309
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:42.484 --> 01:08:45.578
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:45.753 --> 01:08:49.746
Welcome to the stage, my boy, my British
biscuit and y'all's host for the night...


01:08:49.924 --> 01:08:52.415
...Luke Morgan.


01:08:54.996 --> 01:08:57.988
Are you amped for the Wellesley Academy
of the Arts Showcase?


01:08:59.534 --> 01:09:03.630
Good. Because we have Mickey O'Malley
spinning tonight.


01:09:07.575 --> 01:09:13.639
So let's get this party started
with Big Pain Ticket.


01:09:23.391 --> 01:09:27.157
<i>I wanna kiss your apocalypse</i>


01:09:27.328 --> 01:09:30.422
<i>Wrap you in my Armageddon</i>


01:09:30.598 --> 01:09:34.090
<i>Sing you a twisted serenade</i>


01:09:34.269 --> 01:09:37.329
<i>We can run away together</i>


01:09:47.515 --> 01:09:50.245
Hello, Guy. So glad you could make it.


01:09:50.418 --> 01:09:53.444
My two A&R guys, Tom and, uh, Tom.


01:09:54.022 --> 01:09:55.387
Uh, did I miss your big line up?


01:09:55.557 --> 01:09:59.152
You're just in time. And I know
you'll love the closing act. She's amazing.


01:09:59.327 --> 01:10:01.022
Well, I expect nothing less.


01:10:01.195 --> 01:10:06.428
Oh, yeah. Nothing and less are definitely
two words I'd use to describe it.


01:10:06.601 --> 01:10:09.229
Why don't I show you and the Toms
to the VIP section.


01:10:09.404 --> 01:10:12.931
Katie, go help Bev
with her makeup, please.


01:10:13.107 --> 01:10:14.768
- Okay.
- Now.


01:10:14.943 --> 01:10:16.968
This way, please, come on.


01:10:17.145 --> 01:10:19.204
What a lovely suit.


01:10:23.785 --> 01:10:24.877
Move it.


01:10:25.053 --> 01:10:27.453
Hey. Out of the way. Out of the way.
Michael, go on.


01:10:27.622 --> 01:10:29.886
I have to announce what's next.
I'll see you at the end.


01:10:30.058 --> 01:10:31.923
Guy. Tom. Tom.


01:10:32.560 --> 01:10:33.959
I'll be right back.


01:10:36.497 --> 01:10:37.759
Good to see you.


01:10:37.932 --> 01:10:39.797
Nice suit.


01:10:46.641 --> 01:10:50.577
What was that back there?
This is your last chance to get it right.


01:10:50.745 --> 01:10:53.714
Unless you wanna see
Angela's Juilliard dreams go bye-bye.


01:10:53.881 --> 01:10:57.840
That what you wanna be? A little
dwarfish Asian girl's dream crusher, huh?


01:10:58.019 --> 01:10:59.043
- Do you?
- No. No.


01:10:59.220 --> 01:11:02.087
No? No? No? Then focus!


01:11:07.595 --> 01:11:10.257
- Look, Ange, you...
- Gail's been threatening me too.


01:11:10.431 --> 01:11:12.456
That's why you're doing
what she wants.


01:11:12.800 --> 01:11:15.098
- To protect me.
- Ange.


01:11:15.703 --> 01:11:17.637
You're my best friend.


01:11:17.805 --> 01:11:20.239
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:30.718 --> 01:11:32.549
Okay.


01:11:34.789 --> 01:11:39.317
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:45.166 --> 01:11:46.190
Scratch that.


01:11:46.367 --> 01:11:49.302
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:58.012 --> 01:12:00.480
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:12:00.648 --> 01:12:04.550
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:07.355 --> 01:12:08.720
Move it. Guy.


01:12:08.890 --> 01:12:13.088
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:13.261 --> 01:12:14.728
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:14.896 --> 01:12:17.763
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:19.200 --> 01:12:20.394
Well, it had better be.


01:12:20.568 --> 01:12:21.796
I have to pee.


01:12:21.969 --> 01:12:25.200
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:28.142 --> 01:12:29.973
Sorry.


01:12:30.411 --> 01:12:32.936
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:33.114 --> 01:12:38.051
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:38.786 --> 01:12:40.947
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:41.122 --> 01:12:44.182
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:44.358 --> 01:12:46.724
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:46.894 --> 01:12:50.227
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:55.036 --> 01:12:56.367
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:56.537 --> 01:12:57.936
Okay.


01:12:58.272 --> 01:13:00.433
You guys having a good time?


01:13:01.008 --> 01:13:05.411
Let's keep it going
with Beverly Van Ravensway.


01:13:17.525 --> 01:13:19.755
<i>Plug in the mike</i>


01:13:19.927 --> 01:13:21.224
<i>Open the curtain</i>


01:13:21.395 --> 01:13:22.760
<i>Turn on the lights</i>


01:13:23.564 --> 01:13:24.997
<i>I'm through rehearsing</i>


01:13:25.166 --> 01:13:27.259
<i>The feeling ignites</i>


01:13:27.435 --> 01:13:28.493
<i>I'm in control</i>


01:13:28.669 --> 01:13:32.765
<i>The crowd's in the palm of my hand
All my fans stand</i>


01:13:32.940 --> 01:13:36.376
<i>What is the truth?
What's an illusion?</i>


01:13:36.544 --> 01:13:40.241
<i>You're searching for proof
But are you certain?</i>


01:13:40.414 --> 01:13:43.975
<i>Whatever you see is what you get</i>


01:13:44.152 --> 01:13:47.952
<i>If words paint a picture
Then I bet you I can get you, yeah</i>


01:13:48.122 --> 01:13:52.354
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:13:52.527 --> 01:13:55.758
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:13:55.930 --> 01:13:59.366
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I'll make you see</i>


01:13:59.534 --> 01:14:03.231
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:14:03.404 --> 01:14:07.807
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:14:07.975 --> 01:14:09.442
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:13.314 --> 01:14:14.338
Give me...


01:14:21.022 --> 01:14:25.118
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:25.526 --> 01:14:28.017
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:30.898 --> 01:14:33.025
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:38.239 --> 01:14:42.471
How dare you sabotage your mother,
you rotten, rotten little boy?


01:14:42.643 --> 01:14:45.203
You, give me that. It doesn't matter.


01:14:45.379 --> 01:14:48.075
- We'll do it live.
- What? What?


01:14:49.450 --> 01:14:51.384
Ha. My mike is broken. I'm so sorry.


01:14:56.324 --> 01:14:57.450
Here.


01:14:58.826 --> 01:15:00.157
What?


01:15:00.328 --> 01:15:01.955
Stay.


01:15:06.434 --> 01:15:08.231
No, no, no. You gotta get out of here.


01:15:08.636 --> 01:15:11.935
You're about to sing for Bev.
Why are you about to sing for Bev?


01:15:12.874 --> 01:15:13.898
She can't sing.


01:15:20.348 --> 01:15:21.610
Come on.


01:15:21.782 --> 01:15:23.682
Hey. All of you, keep playing.


01:15:24.352 --> 01:15:26.149
Keep playing, you idiots.


01:15:26.320 --> 01:15:28.618
It was your voice the whole time?
Bev never sang at all?


01:15:30.224 --> 01:15:33.591
And she's about to not sing
for a whole bunch of people, so please...


01:15:33.761 --> 01:15:36.958
And on the dates, that... That was you.


01:15:41.402 --> 01:15:43.529
<i>I got nothing to lose</i>


01:15:44.038 --> 01:15:45.403
<i>I've been exposed</i>


01:15:45.573 --> 01:15:47.700
<i>I'm paying my dues</i>


01:15:47.875 --> 01:15:49.035
<i>Playing the role</i>


01:15:49.210 --> 01:15:51.576
<i>I'm breaking the rules</i>


01:15:51.746 --> 01:15:52.940
<i>Flow in the flow</i>


01:15:53.114 --> 01:15:57.073
<i>I got the whole world nodding, yes
Like some bobbleheads</i>


01:15:57.251 --> 01:15:58.616
<i>I'll break a sweat</i>


01:15:59.820 --> 01:16:00.844
<i>If you want it</i>


01:16:01.022 --> 01:16:03.149
<i>Confess all your sins</i>


01:16:03.324 --> 01:16:04.621
<i>You know you got 'em</i>


01:16:04.792 --> 01:16:07.056
<i>The room's in a spin</i>


01:16:07.228 --> 01:16:08.252
<i>The fever's pitched</i>


01:16:08.429 --> 01:16:10.397
- You gotta go. Come on, get out there.
Aah!


01:16:10.564 --> 01:16:12.361
<i>I'm legit, I'm no counterfeit</i>


01:16:12.533 --> 01:16:16.993
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:17.171 --> 01:16:19.935
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:20.107 --> 01:16:23.770
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:23.945 --> 01:16:27.574
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:27.748 --> 01:16:32.151
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:32.320 --> 01:16:33.514
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:33.688 --> 01:16:36.486
Hey! Shut that camera down! Now!


01:16:36.657 --> 01:16:39.125
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:39.293 --> 01:16:43.195
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:43.364 --> 01:16:45.457
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:51.906 --> 01:16:53.703
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:55.543 --> 01:16:58.034
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:17:01.182 --> 01:17:03.582
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:06.887 --> 01:17:08.252
Hey. Clear.


01:17:11.359 --> 01:17:13.759
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:13.928 --> 01:17:15.225
Like what?


01:17:15.496 --> 01:17:17.361
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:17.531 --> 01:17:19.328
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:19.500 --> 01:17:24.870
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:27.641 --> 01:17:29.609
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:37.318 --> 01:17:41.311
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:44.425 --> 01:17:49.055
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:50.297 --> 01:17:53.858
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:54.035 --> 01:17:55.525
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:57.505 --> 01:18:00.941
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:18:01.108 --> 01:18:04.271
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:18:04.445 --> 01:18:07.380
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:07.548 --> 01:18:09.175
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:09.350 --> 01:18:15.084
<i>There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:15.256 --> 01:18:18.555
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:18.726 --> 01:18:21.695
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:21.862 --> 01:18:25.059
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:25.232 --> 01:18:27.632
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:27.802 --> 01:18:30.930
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:32.406 --> 01:18:39.278
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:39.447 --> 01:18:43.110
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:43.284 --> 01:18:50.281
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:50.458 --> 01:18:53.723
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:53.894 --> 01:18:56.795
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:56.964 --> 01:19:04.393
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:04.572 --> 01:19:07.769
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:07.942 --> 01:19:10.911
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:11.078 --> 01:19:14.172
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:14.348 --> 01:19:16.839
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:17.017 --> 01:19:19.747
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:37.271 --> 01:19:38.932
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.


01:19:39.106 --> 01:19:42.507
We hope you enjoyed the Wellesley
Academy of Arts Showcase.


01:19:42.676 --> 01:19:45.236
Oh, my God, you were so good.


01:19:45.613 --> 01:19:47.945
Who are you?
You're like a freaking rock star.


01:19:48.115 --> 01:19:50.208
Are you kidding me? Man, she likes you...


01:20:01.428 --> 01:20:04.363
So, what did he say? Is he mad?


01:20:04.532 --> 01:20:06.193
Yeah. He's pretty ticked off...


01:20:06.367 --> 01:20:10.133
...that I'm not already making
the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:12.106 --> 01:20:13.869
Oh. Which album?


01:20:14.775 --> 01:20:15.799
Your album.


01:20:17.478 --> 01:20:19.469
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:21.081 --> 01:20:23.549
- You're... You're serious?
- Uh-huh.


01:20:25.786 --> 01:20:27.117
Go for it.


01:20:27.288 --> 01:20:30.052
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:30.224 --> 01:20:32.283
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:32.459 --> 01:20:34.256
You know, I sing too.


01:20:34.428 --> 01:20:38.057
I can do a whole monologue album.
Incredible. Hey, congratulations.


01:20:38.232 --> 01:20:42.760
- Yo, blow it up. Boom.
I'm your boy. Call me up.


01:20:42.937 --> 01:20:46.338
Yeah. Yeah, he's really good
at guitars. He's a kook.


01:21:01.055 --> 01:21:02.647
Guy! Wait!


01:21:02.823 --> 01:21:06.315
- What now, Gail? More lies?
- Well, everyone lies in this business.


01:21:06.493 --> 01:21:07.517
It's called spin.


01:21:08.162 --> 01:21:09.527
So Bev can't sing.


01:21:09.697 --> 01:21:11.426
That didn't stop Jessica Simpson.


01:21:11.599 --> 01:21:15.194
Well, we'll see what the school board
thinks when I get them a ring, shall we?


01:21:15.569 --> 01:21:18.367
How dare you? Teaching is my life.


01:21:18.539 --> 01:21:20.473
Give it up, Mom.


01:21:22.676 --> 01:21:24.143
Guy!


01:21:25.479 --> 01:21:29.142
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:29.383 --> 01:21:33.149
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:34.622 --> 01:21:37.682
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:37.858 --> 01:21:40.452
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:40.628 --> 01:21:42.186
Let's try this again.


01:21:42.396 --> 01:21:44.261
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:45.833 --> 01:21:48.563
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:14.228 --> 01:22:16.458
Hey. Clear.


01:22:32.146 --> 01:22:34.307
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:34.481 --> 01:22:36.847
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:18.726 --> 01:23:21.320
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:21.495 --> 01:23:24.362
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:29.336 --> 01:23:32.863
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:39.313 --> 01:23:41.372
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:46.553 --> 01:23:50.853
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:55.295 --> 01:23:58.287
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:58.465 --> 01:24:00.592
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:20.087 --> 01:24:21.952
I love my life.


01:24:22.122 --> 01:24:24.317
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:46.780 --> 01:24:49.977
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

